ReqCtxNew main path: create with connected uio + path, host from peer IP, default limits, WRITE_HDR state
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTX_TC001:

ReqCtxNew with uio NULL returns NULL
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTX_TC002:

ReqCtxNew with path NULL returns NULL
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTX_TC003:

ReqCtxNew with memory allocation failure returns NULL
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTX_TC004:

SetReq main path: request header contains request line, Content-Type and Content-Length (no Host by default)
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTX_TC005:

SetReq with an empty request body produces Content-Length: 0
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTX_TC006:

SetReq with ctx NULL returns parameter error
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTX_TC007:

SetReq with contentType NULL returns parameter error
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTX_TC008:

ReqCtxFree main path: releases resources, uio stays usable
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTX_TC025:

ReqCtxFree with ctx NULL is safe
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTX_TC026:

ReqCtxNew rejects an over-long path
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTX_TC027:

SetReq rejects an over-long Content-Type
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTX_TC028:

AddHeader main path: custom Accept header is included in the request
SDV_BSL_HTTP_ADDHEADER_TC001:

AddHeader with NULL ctx/name/value returns parameter error
SDV_BSL_HTTP_ADDHEADER_TC002:

AddHeader rejects framing headers Content-Type/Content-Length but accepts Host
SDV_BSL_HTTP_ADDHEADER_TC003:

AddHeader rejects CR/LF injection in header values
SDV_BSL_HTTP_ADDHEADER_TC004:

AddHeader after SetReq succeeds (order-independent)
SDV_BSL_HTTP_ADDHEADER_TC005:

AddHeader rejects an over-long header value
SDV_BSL_HTTP_ADDHEADER_TC006:

AddHeader rejects an over-long header name
SDV_BSL_HTTP_ADDHEADER_TC007:

AddHeader header count limit is enforced
SDV_BSL_HTTP_ADDHEADER_TC008:

Set and get MAX_RESP_LEN round-trips 50KB
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTRL_TC001:

Set and get MAX_RESP_HDR_LINES round-trips 128
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTRL_TC002:

Set EXPECTED_CT stores a deep copy
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTRL_TC003:

Set EXPECTED_CT with NULL clears the value
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTRL_TC004:

Invalid Ctrl command returns parameter error
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTRL_TC005:

AddHeader("Host") appends the Host header, order-independent with SetReq
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTRL_TC006:

AddHeader("Host") rejects NULL, injection and over-long values
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTRL_TC007:

SET ctrl commands are rejected once the transfer starts
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTRL_TC008:

Setting a 0 response limit is rejected
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTRL_TC009:

Set/get max response line length and reject out-of-range values
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTRL_TC010:

A response line longer than maxLineLen is rejected
SDV_BSL_HTTP_CTRL_TC011:

HttpParseDecimal ignores a stale errno
SDV_BSL_HTTP_PARSE_TC001:

HttpParseStatusLine validates the minor-version token
SDV_BSL_HTTP_PARSE_TC002:

HttpParseHeaderLine rejects an empty field name
SDV_BSL_HTTP_PARSE_TC003:

Non-blocking full send/receive round trip succeeds and returns the body
SDV_BSL_HTTP_EXCHANGE_TC001:

Non-blocking retry does not lose intermediate state
SDV_BSL_HTTP_EXCHANGE_TC002:

Blocking mode loops until completion
SDV_BSL_HTTP_EXCHANGE_TC003:

Response header line limit is enforced
SDV_BSL_HTTP_EXCHANGE_TC004:

Response body size limit is enforced
SDV_BSL_HTTP_EXCHANGE_TC005:

Content-Type mismatch is rejected
SDV_BSL_HTTP_EXCHANGE_TC006:

I/O error is reported
SDV_BSL_HTTP_EXCHANGE_TC007:

HTTP/1.1 response is accepted
SDV_BSL_HTTP_EXCHANGE_TC008:

Malformed status line is rejected
